        {
            "anchor": "intro",
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Intro to Earth Flora",
            "item": {
                "tag": "tfc:plants"
            },
            "text": "Earth is an incredibly diverse planet when it comes to flora. Unlike in vanilla $(thing)Minecraft$()--Plants in $(tfg) spawn based on local $(l:the_world/climate#climate)Climate Conditions$()."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "Plants may be difficult to find during some $(l:the_world/climate#seasons)Seasons$() as they go through cycles of flowering and laying dormant, or changing color as the local temperature changes.$(br2)Colorful flowers can typically be crushed in a $(l:craftsmanship/quern)Quern$() for $(thing)Dye$(). While some plants can be used for making $(l:the_world/flora#medicinal_plants)medicine$() or $(l:the_world/flora#spices)meals$()."
        },
